# Agent scratch — probe screenshots and one-off scripts (88 MB, not part of the theme)
_work/

# Probe output — regenerated by tools/probe-*.py and `python tools/s2-palette.py --json`
out/

# The generated browser bundle. Built from src/ + the wallpaper manifest, and NOT
# tracked since 2026-10-09 (D79): the bundle is what carries the art as data URLs,
# so keeping it out of git is what makes "the remote has no wallpaper" structural
# instead of a promise. Run `node tools/build-client.mjs` after a checkout.
client.js

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---- 凭据与密钥：绝不允许进入本仓库（远程是公开仓库）----
# 2026-10-16: 本仓库此前没有任何 .env 忽略规则，.env 一旦出现在仓库根目录
# 就会被 git add 并推到公开远程。以下规则结构性阻断该路径。
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
.credentials.yaml
.credentials.yml
.credentials.json
credentials.json
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
sec.json
sec.yaml
sec.yml
secret.json
secret.yaml
secret.yml
creds.json
creds.yaml
creds.yml
*credential*
*secret*
.netrc
.npmrc.local
*service-account*.json
service-account*.json
*token*.json
*.bak
*.backup
